Short:     StarDate-Clock 68000 (CLI) for free use
Author:    Michaela Pruess (320022874706-9999@t-online.de)
Uploader:  Michaela Pruess (320022874706-9999@t-online.de)
Kurz:      Sternzeit-Uhr 68000 (CLI) zur freien Benutzung
Type:      util/cli
URL:       http://www.flagranti.net/gateway/airgate.html
Version:   1.4.15


English:   (deutsch, siehe unten)

About:     This is a free copy of the Gateway-5-BBS-StarDate-Clock-Utility.
           Gateway-5 is a german only BBS-System. Because this, the internal
           help of StarDate is in german.
           Here the english translation:
           ?           show release-information and used tools for create
                       this program.
           -h          this help, but in german
           -d<digits>  number of digits after decimalpoint
           -t<hours>   timezone (-12 to 12 hours from greenwich)
           -o<file>    file for output, don't print to cli

Requires:  Amiga :-)
           The are version's for all different CPU-types from 68000 up to
           powerpc (PowerUp).

Install:   Copy the File StarDate in any directory you like and start it
           from CLI.

